IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-STREAM-K-DECOMP.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ROWS-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COLS-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-WORKERS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TOTAL-MAC           PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 BASE-CHUNK          PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 REMAINDER-UNITS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-STREAM-K.
    IF NUM-WORKERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE TOTAL-MAC = ROWS-COUNT * COLS-COUNT.
    COMPUTE BASE-CHUNK = TOTAL-MAC / NUM-WORKERS.
    COMPUTE REMAINDER-UNITS = TOTAL-MAC - (BASE-CHUNK * NUM-WORKERS).

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BASE-CHUNK.
    WEIGHT 30 REMAINDER-UNITS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
